    {
      "name": "09 Socket.IO (Postman Socket.IO tab)",
      "description": "Socket.IO cannot use plain REST. In Postman:\n\n1. **New → Socket.IO Request**\n2. URL: `{{baseUrl}}` (e.g. http://localhost:5000)\n3. **Headers** tab: `Authorization` = `Bearer {{jwt}}`\n4. Click **Connect**\n5. Use **Events** tab to emit/listen\n\n### Auth\nSocket handshake reads `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>` from headers (same as REST).\n\n### Emit (chef token for cooking-step / cooking-timer)\n| Event | Payload |\n|-------|--------|\n| `join-recipe` | `\"<recipeId>\"` or `{ \"recipeId\": \"<id>\" }` |\n| `cooking-step` | `{ \"recipeId\": \"<id>\", \"step\": \"Chop onions\" }` |\n| `cooking-timer` | `{ \"recipeId\": \"<id>\", \"duration\": 120 }` |\n| `chat-message` | `{ \"recipeId\": \"<id>\", \"message\": \"Hello @chef\" }` |\n| `message` (Postman fallback) | `{ \"event\": \"cooking-step\", \"data\": { \"recipeId\": \"<id>\", \"step\": \"Stir\" } }` |\n\n### Listen\n| Event | Meaning |\n|-------|--------|\n| `room-users` | User IDs in room |\n| `step-update` | Chef broadcast step |\n| `timer-start` | Countdown started |\n| `chat-message` | New chat in room |\n| `new-notification` | Like, comment, mention, etc. |\n| `session-ended` | Chef ended live session |\n| `error` | Server-side error string |\n\n### Stage 0 socket checks\n1. Connect with user JWT → no auth error\n2. `join-recipe` after chef started session → `room-users` received\n3. Chef emits `cooking-step` → listener gets **one** `step-update` with `{ step, by, at }`\n4. `chat-message` with `@mention` → no crash (parseMentions fix)\n5. Optional: `message` fallback with `cooking-step` → same as direct emit",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[Doc] Socket connect settings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
            "description": "Open a Socket.IO request (not this REST call). URL={{baseUrl}}, Header Authorization=Bearer {{jwt}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Emit] join-recipe",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
            "description": "Socket.IO emit:\n- Event: `join-recipe`\n- Message: `{{recipeId}}`\n\nPrerequisite: POST /api/cooking/{{recipeId}}/start-session as chef first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[Emit] cooking-step (chef)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{chefJwt}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
            "description": "Socket.IO emit:\n- Event: `cooking-step`\n- Message: `{ \"recipeId\": \"{{recipeId}}\", \"step\": \"Add garlic\" }`\n\nExpect listeners: `step-update` with `{ step, by, at }`."
          }
        },
        {
